<title>USA: SCI Systems Q1 Sept 29 net higher. [CORRECTED 15:30 GMT]</title>
<headline>SCI Systems Q1 Sept 29 net higher. [CORRECTED 15:30 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>HUNTSVILLE, Ala. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr pri		    $0.83		    $0.51</p>
<p> shr dil		    $0.75		    $0.51</p>
<p> Net			 25,000		   15,000</p>
<p> Sales		   1,42,000		  878,000</p>
<p>(Corrects 1995 sales from 887,000)</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: First quarter of fiscal year 1997 was the initial quarter in which the full dilution effect of the Convertible Subordinated Notes issued in May 1996 was experienced.</p>
<p>Quarter end order backlog was $2.80 billion compared with $2.50 billion a year earlier.  Liquidity of $750 million was available at quarter end to fund planned future growth.</p>
</text>
